       :source-occurrence-id
       "A6/source/fdb776b6232fb2880e56ba0ff57436537e33779a7876bc08320e3cc639f8999c",
       :raw-text
       "- `:recorded-effects` records model, tool, memory, human-review, clock, and random outputs on first execution.\n",
